{"seq":44,"slug":"tropical-geometry","title":"热带几何","stage":"DONE","category":"mathematics-statistics","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/tropical-geometry","rating":{"composite":4.1,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"热带几何\">热带几何</h1><p>把加法换成取最小、把乘法换成加法，代数几何里那些弯曲的曲线与曲面就会「塌缩」成一堆折线和多面体。这就是热带几何：它用分段线性的骨架去逼近经典代数几何的对象，让原本需要交换代数硬啃的问题，变成组合与凸几何里能直接画出来、数出来的东西。这个反直觉的名字并非源自某种几何形状，而是为了纪念巴西计算机科学家 Imre Simon 在 min-plus 半环上的开创性工作——「热带」只是同行对巴西的戏称。</p>\n<p>本 hub 沿四条主线递进。第一条是<strong>基础</strong>：先说清为什么要把代数几何「退化」成折线（<a href=\"foundations/why-tropical\">为何热带几何</a>），再把底层代数结构——min-plus 半环——的公理与反常之处讲透（<a href=\"foundations/min-plus-semiring\">min-plus 半环</a>），最后用赋值与 Puiseux 级数把经典对象「热带化」的机制交代清楚（<a href=\"foundations/tropicalization\">热带化</a>）。第二条是<strong>曲线</strong>：从热带多项式与 Newton 多边形的对偶（<a href=\"curves/tropical-polynomials\">热带多项式与 Newton 多边形</a>），到热带曲线作为不可微轨迹的几何形态（<a href=\"curves/tropical-curves\">热带曲线</a>），再到把这一切钉死的平衡条件（<a href=\"curves/balancing-condition\">平衡条件</a>）。第三条是<strong>理论</strong>：把维数抬高到热带簇（<a href=\"theory/tropical-varieties\">热带簇</a>），用基本定理把三种定义焊在一起（<a href=\"theory/fundamental-theorem\">基本定理</a>），并单独处理 max-plus 谱理论这一自成体系的分支（<a href=\"theory/tropical-linear\">热带线性代数</a>）。第四条是<strong>应用</strong>：系统发生学里的树空间（<a href=\"practice/phylogenetics\">系统发生学</a>）、离散事件系统的调度（<a href=\"practice/optimization-scheduling\">优化与调度</a>），以及软件生态、神经网络与边界（<a href=\"practice/tropical-geometry-in-practice\">应用与边界</a>）。</p>\n<p>本 hub 与几个兄弟 hub 有明确分工，不越界重复。凸集、线性规划与对偶的一般理论属于 <a href=\"../optimization-theory/\">05_optimization-theory</a>，本 hub 只讲它们如何在 min-plus 语义下重新出现；最短路、匹配这类图算法的实现细节属于 <a href=\"../graph-theory/\">13_graph-theory</a>，本 hub 只用它们作为热带矩阵幂的实例；生成函数与计数属于 <a href=\"../combinatorics/\">14_combinatorics</a>；拟阵与贪心的公理体系属于 <a href=\"../matroid-theory/\">40_matroid-theory</a>，本 hub 只在热带线性空间处引用赋值拟阵；凸包、Voronoi 图这类计算几何构造属于 <a href=\"../computational-geometry/\">39_computational-geometry</a>；半环、环、域的抽象代数框架属于 <a href=\"../abstract-algebra/\">18_abstract-algebra</a>。</p>\n<p>推荐学习路径分三类读者。<strong>代数几何背景</strong>的读者可略读基础章，直奔第二、三章看热带化如何保留经典不变量；<strong>优化 / 运筹背景</strong>的读者建议从 min-plus 半环入手，跳到第四章的调度与线性代数，再回头补曲线的几何直觉；<strong>机器学习 / 数据科学背景</strong>的读者可先读基础章建立语感，然后径直阅读系统发生学与应用边界两篇，看热带凸性如何处理非欧数据。前置知识方面：读懂基础章只需线性代数与一点点多项式常识；第三章的基本定理会用到域上赋值与理想的概念，可按需回查 <a href=\"../abstract-algebra/\">18_abstract-algebra</a>；应用章的调度部分假设读者熟悉图上的最短路，可回查 <a href=\"../graph-theory/\">13_graph-theory</a>。</p>\n<p>四条主线不是并列的知识点堆叠，而是一条从「为什么」到「是什么」再到「能干什么」的递进：基础章建立语言，曲线章在最低维把几何直觉喂饱，理论章把直觉抬到任意维并证明它可靠，应用章则把这套语言放回真实数据与工程问题里检验它的边界。建议至少通读基础章与曲线章，它们是理解后两章的公共前提。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/tropical-geometry/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-tropical","title":"为何热带几何","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/tropical-geometry/foundations/why-tropical"},{"seq":2,"slug":"min-plus-semiring","title":"min-plus 半环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/tropical-geometry/foundations/min-plus-semiring"},{"seq":3,"slug":"tropicalization","title":"热带化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/tropical-geometry/foundations/tropicalization"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"curves","title":"曲线","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/tropical-geometry/curves","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tropical-polynomials","title":"热带多项式与 Newton 多边形","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/tropical-geometry/curves/tropical-polynomials"},{"seq":2,"slug":"tropical-curves","title":"热带曲线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/tropical-geometry/curves/tropical-curves"},{"seq":3,"slug":"balancing-condition","title":"平衡条件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/tropical-geometry/curves/balancing-condition"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"theory","title":"理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/tropical-geometry/theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tropical-varieties","title":"热带簇","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/tropical-geometry/theory/tropical-varieties"},{"seq":2,"slug":"fundamental-theorem","title":"基本定理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/tropical-geometry/theory/fundamental-theorem"},{"seq":3,"slug":"tropical-linear","title":"热带线性代数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/tropical-geometry/theory/tropical-linear"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"应用","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/tropical-geometry/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"phylogenetics","title":"系统发生学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/tropical-geometry/practice/phylogenetics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"optimization-scheduling","title":"优化与调度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/tropical-geometry/practice/optimization-scheduling"},{"seq":3,"slug":"tropical-geometry-in-practice","title":"应用与边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/tropical-geometry/practice/tropical-geometry-in-practice"}]}]}